  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Sustainable Anti-Corruption Action in Tanzania (BSAAT)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This action aims to reduce the role of corruption as a barrier to poverty reduction in TZ by improving the capacity &amp; coordination of the criminal justice system in corruption cases, improving integrity &amp; governance in the private sector &amp; influencing social change through research &amp; media</narrative>
  </description>
